---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Sale" description="Kidtoy Factory B2B terms of sale - quotation, MOQ, OEM/ODM, quality inspection, shipment and governing law for wholesale toy orders.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-navy mb-2">Terms of Sale</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8">Last updated: 21 October 2026 · Applies to all B2B wholesale orders</p>

    <div class="prose max-w-none text-gray-500 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">1. Scope</h2>
      <p>These terms govern wholesale and OEM/ODM orders placed with Kidtoy Factory (Chenghai, Guangdong, China) through this website, email or WhatsApp. They apply to business buyers only. Where a signed proforma invoice (PI) or contract states different terms, the signed document prevails.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">2. Quotations and Pricing</h2>
      <p>Prices shown on this website are indicative ex-works reference prices in US dollars and may change with raw material costs and exchange rates. A binding price is established only in a written quotation or proforma invoice issued by us and confirmed by you. Prices do not include freight, insurance, duties or taxes unless expressly stated.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">3. Minimum Order Quantity</h2>
      <p>Standard MOQ is 50 pieces per design. Selected bubble toys and small accessories may be ordered from 36 pieces. Custom OEM/ODM orders typically start at 500–1,000 units depending on tooling and packaging complexity.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">4. Orders and Payment</h2>
      <p>An order becomes binding when we confirm it in writing and receive the deposit specified in the proforma invoice. Payment schedule, currency and method are stated in each PI. Production lead time is counted from the later of deposit receipt or approval of samples and artwork.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">5. Samples and Approvals</h2>
      <p>Existing-product samples ship within 2–3 days; custom samples take 7–14 days. Sample fees are refundable against a bulk order. Bulk production follows the approved sample, artwork and specification sheet. Buyer-supplied designs remain the buyer's property; the buyer warrants that they do not infringe third-party rights.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">6. Quality and Inspection</h2>
      <p>Goods are produced under our factory quality system and inspected before shipment. Buyers may arrange third-party inspection (SGS, BV, Intertek, etc.) at their own cost before shipment, provided it is scheduled within the agreed production window. Buyers have 7 calendar days from receipt to report quality discrepancies with photographic evidence.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">7. Compliance and Certification</h2>
      <p>Our factory holds ISO 22716 (GMPC), BSCI, SEDEX and GSV certification. Products can be supplied to meet CE (EN71), ASTM F963, CPSIA and EN62115 requirements where specified in the order. Destination-market compliance, labeling and registration obligations remain the buyer's responsibility unless we expressly agree in writing to handle them.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">8. Shipment, Risk and Title</h2>
      <p>Unless otherwise agreed, goods are sold ex-works or FOB as stated in the PI. Risk passes according to the agreed Incoterm. Shipping dates are estimates given in good faith; we are not liable for delays caused by carriers, customs, port congestion or force majeure.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">9. Returns and Claims</h2>
      <p>Returns are accepted only for manufacturing defects or incorrect shipment, as set out in our <a href="/refund/" class="text-orange hover:underline">Refund &amp; Return Policy</a>. As a B2B supplier we do not accept returns for change of mind, over-ordering or slow sell-through.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">10. Liability</h2>
      <p>Our liability for any order is limited to the invoiced value of the goods concerned. We are not liable for indirect or consequential loss, including lost profit or lost sales.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">11. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China. The parties will first attempt to resolve disputes amicably; failing that, disputes are submitted to the competent court at our place of business.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">12. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:hntoys6@sinuotoys.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">hntoys6@sinuotoys.com</a> or WhatsApp +86 13715961913.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
